im-test-47967/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1263/202002172051514190001.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Silver Medal\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      Hardware Cooking\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Silver Medal</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      Equiped with a high capacity SSD, this bundle has become a necessary to for us to navigate through our various test configurations.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>FRANCE</span> <span>02/15/2020</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG STRIX ARION Media review Award of Silver Medal\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.hardwarecooking.fr/test-asus-rog-strix-arion/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1337/15441.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Recomended\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      NewEsc España\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Recomended</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      Durability and performance for external units\n\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>SPAIN</span> <span>10/28/2019</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG STRIX ARION Media review Award of Recomended\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://newesc.com/review-rog-strix-arion/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1352/201912131933430560775.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Editor's Choice\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      LEVEL\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Editor's Choice</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      ROG Strix Arion is definitely an impressive device with its design, use and performance.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>Türkiye</span> <span>04/01/2020</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG STRIX ARION Media review Award of Editor's Choice\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1352/15343.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Editor's Choice\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      Chip Online\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Editor's Choice</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      It is certain that Strix Arion is a very impressive device with its design, usage and performance. It is necessary to accept that the product is first class in every sense.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>Türkiye</span> <span>03/18/2020</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG STRIX ARION Media review Award of Editor's Choice\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.chip.com.tr/inceleme/asus-rog-strix-arion_5543.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1252/202009042235216900101.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"DD´s Recommended\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      www.ddworld.cz\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>DD´s Recommended</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      The case itself is very handy, very functional. It has a great design. It warms up a bit in use as it also serves as a passive for the relatively NVMe SSD inside. But because we don't get the discs to their full potential, temperatures are normally up to 45° C. I highly recommend ASUS Strix Arion for those who want a really fast external disk in their pocket.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>CZECH REPUBLIC</span> <span>03/09/2020</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG STRIX ARION Media review Award of DD´s Recommended\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"http://www.ddworld.cz/pc-a-komponenty/pevne-disky/asus-rog-strix-arion-test-a-recenze-pouzdra-pro-m.2-nvme-ssd-a-rychly-disk-do-kapsy--4.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1333/202106290108479120576.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Top Notch\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      hwcooling.net\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Top Notch</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      A more expensive case, but robust and with richer accessories.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>SLOVAKIA</span> <span>08/12/2024</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG STRIX ARION Media review Award of Top Notch\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.hwcooling.net/asus-rog-strix-arion-jedno-z-najlepsie-vybavenych-puzdier-ssd/4/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/2004/202004030041092950759.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"AXE Advanced Design\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      PC AXE\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>AXE Advanced Design</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      ROG Strix ARION has earned Advanced Design award. \n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>REPUBLIC OF SERBIA</span> <span>09/26/2021</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG STRIX ARION Media review Award of AXE Advanced Design\" tabindex=\"0\" hr